          "Low-cut lace-up outdoor shoes with panelled uppers and a visible textured outsole. Three supplier colors: Black, Tan and Beige. Supplier size labels 36-48; size chart and fit require confirmation before ordering. Wholesale enquiries can include color and size mix, quantity, packaging and destination. This is an externally sourced supplier style; availability, material composition, quotation and dispatch timing are confirmed for each order. Customization feasibility is reviewed on request and is not confirmed for this style.",
          []
        ]
